<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><fdroid><repo icon="icon.png" name="Nova" pubkey="" timestamp="1789753275" url="https://nova-app.eu/fdroid/repo" version="20002"><description>Репозиторий Nova для Android от автора приложения: те же APK, что в релизах на GitHub, подписанные ключом автора. Новая версия появляется здесь вскоре после выхода релиза. Nova for Android from its author: the developer-signed APKs of the GitHub releases.</description><mirror>https://confeden.github.io/nova-fdroid/fdroid/repo</mirror></repo><application id="com.brent.nova"><id>com.brent.nova</id><added>2026-09-16</added><lastupdated>2026-09-18</lastupdated><name>Nova</name><summary>VPN client with WireGuard/AmneziaWG, MASQUE, VLESS and Opera proxy transports</summary><desc>Nova is a VPN client for Android with several transports: WireGuard/AmneziaWG with obfuscation, MASQUE (CONNECT-IP over HTTP/3 and HTTP/2), VLESS with REALITY, and a proxy mode through Opera's servers.

Features:

* a bundled set of tested AmneziaWG profiles, ranked by session-hold measurements;
* detection of a stalled return stream on a live tunnel: the app asks for a new handshake itself and, if that does not help, moves to another node without dropping application connections;
* import of your own profiles and subscriptions;
* per-app split tunnelling;
* DNS settings, including a separate resolver for a chosen app;
* sharing the tunnel with devices tethered to the phone.

The transports rely on non-free network services: Cloudflare WARP/MASQUE and Opera's proxy servers.
